38,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"I found the spray costs about 2,300 yen monthly, often bought twice. The office cleaner is 4,200 yen an hour, billed to one person.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The previous tenants divided rooms permanently, yet two barely spoke by year two. Our rows began with reminders. We must avoid that silence.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
